# Detection Logic

Validated detection concept:

```spl
index=* "schtasks.exe" "/create"
```

Host-specific validation:

```spl
index=* host="WIN11-02" "schtasks.exe" "/create"
```

Portfolio-formatted version:

```spl
index=* "schtasks.exe" "/create"
| eval detection="DET-004 - Suspicious Scheduled Task Creation"
| table _time detection host _raw
```

Additional extracted fields should only be added after confirming they exist in the indexed telemetry.

