This may connect DET-003 and DET-004 during a larger investigation.

---

# Network Correlation

Network activity around task creation should be reviewed where available.

Potentially higher-risk behavior:

```text
Scheduled Task
      +
External Network Activity
      +
Suspicious Script/Executable
